<title>USA: Exxon Corp Q1 net up 15 pct.</title>
<headline>Exxon Corp Q1 net up 15 pct.</headline>
<dateline>IRVING, Texas 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.87		    $0.76</p>
<p> Net		    2,175,000		1,885,000</p>
<p> Revs		  33,590,000	     31,205,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs	     2,483,800		2,483,900</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: 1996 net includes credit of $125 million.</p>
<p>Share data restated to reflect 2-for-1 stock split effective March 14, 1997.</p>
<p>First Call Q1 consensus estimate was $0.83.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
